incorporation_legal_framework.pro_forma_first_board_resolution_en:
RESOLVED that the sole member hereby subscribes to and takes all ordinary shares offered in the SPC's constitutional document, for cash consideration to be deposited in the SPC's bank account;
FURTHER RESOLVED that the registered office of the SPC shall be [address], Sultanate of Oman, and said address is adopted for receipt of official notices and service under the Commercial Companies Law;
FURTHER RESOLVED that [Name/Passport No.] is appointed Manager/Director of the SPC, with powers stated in the constitution, to execute all filings, open bank accounts, and perfect the company's formation;
FINALLY RESOLVED that the Manager/Director shall cause this resolution to be inserted in the corporate records and produce certified copies to banks, regulators, and counterparties as required.
